WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.252 --> 00:00:03.419
(upbeat reggae music)

00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:07.403
- [Voiceover] Once upon a
time there was a temple,

00:00:07.403 --> 00:00:08.810
it was pretty dope.

00:00:08.810 --> 00:00:10.381
Three goddesses lived there.

00:00:10.381 --> 00:00:12.487
The Truth Goddess, who
always told the truth.

00:00:12.487 --> 00:00:14.471
The Lie Goddess, who lied down a lot,

00:00:14.471 --> 00:00:16.367
but also was a huge liar.

00:00:16.367 --> 00:00:18.847
And the Wisdom Goddess,
who sometimes lied,

00:00:18.847 --> 00:00:20.708
and sometimes told the truth.

00:00:20.708 --> 00:00:23.601
Weirdly, all three
looked exactly the same,

00:00:23.601 --> 00:00:25.751
so no body could tell them apart.

00:00:25.751 --> 00:00:28.724
One day a traveler came
by, and he was like,

00:00:28.724 --> 00:00:32.029
"Yo, I got a dentist
appointment, can you guys move?"

00:00:32.029 --> 00:00:34.598
The Goddesses said, "You may only pass if

00:00:34.598 --> 00:00:38.931
"you tell us apart, so
give it a shot I guess."

00:00:38.931 --> 00:00:40.750
He asked the Goddess on the left,

00:00:40.750 --> 00:00:42.198
"Who's the middle Goddess?"

00:00:42.198 --> 00:00:44.184
"Truth," she replied.

00:00:44.184 --> 00:00:47.080
He asked the Goddess in
the middle, "Who are you?"

00:00:47.080 --> 00:00:48.894
"Wisdom," she answered.

00:00:48.894 --> 00:00:50.135
He asked the Goddess on the right,

00:00:50.135 --> 00:00:51.912
"Who is the middle Goddess?"

00:00:51.912 --> 00:00:54.518
"She's the liar," the Goddess replied.

00:00:54.518 --> 00:00:57.121
The man made his dentist
appointment, and boy,

00:00:57.121 --> 00:00:58.778
did his teeth sparkle.

00:00:58.778 --> 00:01:02.103
How did he tell the Goddesses apart?

00:01:02.103 --> 00:01:05.865
- I have no idea, I'm
already, this is terrible.

00:01:05.865 --> 00:01:07.683
- Is there like a phone-a-friend option?

00:01:07.683 --> 00:01:11.266
- I feel like the middle
Goddess would say.

00:01:12.264 --> 00:01:13.391
- See that's the other
thing, I don't really

00:01:13.391 --> 00:01:14.686
give up too easily.

00:01:14.686 --> 00:01:17.949
- If you asked Goddess
that lies, if you go,

00:01:17.949 --> 00:01:19.354
"Hey what color's my shirt?"

00:01:19.354 --> 00:01:22.129
You're wearing a white
shirt, and the Goddess says,

00:01:22.129 --> 00:01:23.084
"You're wearing a black shirt."

00:01:23.084 --> 00:01:24.499
You know she's lying.

00:01:24.499 --> 00:01:26.280
- Wisdom sometimes says what?

00:01:26.280 --> 00:01:27.564
A little of each?

00:01:27.564 --> 00:01:28.641
A little of each.

00:01:28.641 --> 00:01:30.089
That's not very helpful.

00:01:30.089 --> 00:01:32.905
If she is Truth, then she can't be

00:01:32.905 --> 00:01:35.060
saying that the other girl's Truth.

00:01:35.060 --> 00:01:37.503
- That could still make that one Truth,

00:01:37.503 --> 00:01:41.598
still telling the truth,
no, no, no, no, no.

00:01:41.598 --> 00:01:43.213
- And then you'll figure out
that's the Truth Goddess,

00:01:43.213 --> 00:01:45.119
and then to the left,
is the lying Goddess.

00:01:45.119 --> 00:01:47.806
- Also, just to let you
know, I'm real tired.

00:01:47.806 --> 00:01:51.992
- Liar, middle wisdom,
right true, wisdom, truth.

00:01:51.992 --> 00:01:54.634
- Last I think I said was,

00:01:54.634 --> 00:01:57.849
wisdom, middle was lying
and right was true.

00:01:57.849 --> 00:01:58.682
- Is that true?

00:01:58.682 --> 00:02:00.210
Is this it, is that the answer? (chuckles)

00:02:00.210 --> 00:02:03.293
- Yeah, go ahead, just tell it to me.

00:02:04.761 --> 00:02:06.590
- [Voiceover] The left Goddess is Wisdom,

00:02:06.590 --> 00:02:11.019
the middle Goddess is lying,
and the right Goddess is Truth.

00:02:11.019 --> 00:02:13.746
The Goddess on the left
said the middle on is Truth.

00:02:13.746 --> 00:02:16.311
So, the left cannot be
Truth because they're cannot

00:02:16.311 --> 00:02:18.144
be two Truth Goddesses.

00:02:18.144 --> 00:02:20.540
The Goddess in the middle
said she was Wisdom.

00:02:20.540 --> 00:02:22.165
In that case, she cannot be Truth,

00:02:22.165 --> 00:02:23.473
or she would have said so.

00:02:23.473 --> 00:02:25.802
So, the Goddess on the
right must be Truth,

00:02:25.802 --> 00:02:28.481
and according to her,
the middle one is Lie.

00:02:28.481 --> 00:02:31.695
As a result, the Goddess
on the left is Wisdom.

00:02:31.695 --> 00:02:34.945
(upbeat reggae music)

